gth_bonus%%%力量加成，并且拥有在%splash_radius%范围内造成%splash_pct%%%攻击伤害的溅射攻击。", "en": "Decreases Cooldown to %AbilityCooldown% seconds. When casting Overgrowth, Treant Protector draws power from the soil, greatly increasing his size for %bloom_duration% seconds. While enlarged, he gains phased movement with a fixed speed of %movement_speed%, %strength_bonus%%% bonus Strength, and a splashing attack that deals %splash_pct%%% of his attack damage in a %splash_radius% unit radius."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "radius", "damage", "bloom_duration", "strength_bonus", "splash_pct", "splash_radius", "movement_speed", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "ogre_magi_fireblast", "name_zh": "食人魔魔法师·火焰爆轰", "name_en": "Fireblast", "description_zh": "以一波火焰轰击一个敌方单位，造成伤害并使目标眩晕。", "description_en": "Blasts an enemy unit with a wave of fire, dealing damage and stunning the target.", "notes_zh": ["触发多重施法时，两次火焰爆轰之间有%multicast_delay%秒的间隔。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "很精通的火焰爆轰，冷却时间减少%bonus_AbilityCooldown%秒，施法速度提升%bonus_cast_speed%%%。", "en": "Fireblast is refined, reducing cooldown by %bonus_AbilityCooldown%s and increasing cast speed by %bonus_cast_speed%%%."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["stun_duration", "multicast_delay", "fireblast_damage", "fireblast_proc", "bonus_cast_speed", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "ogre_magi_ignite", "name_zh": "食人魔魔法师·引燃", "name_en": "Ignite", "description_zh": "使目标和另一个随机单位浸透在挥发性化学物质中，导致其瞬间被火焰吞噬。目标处在极度痛苦之中，受到伤害并且移动缓慢。", "description_en": "Drenches the target and another random unit in volatile chemicals, causing it to burst into flames. The target is in immense pain, taking damage and moving more slowly.", "notes_zh": ["多重施法将使此技能有几率对%ignite_multicast_aoe%范围内的随机敌方单位进行多次施放。", "引燃现在击中已受到作用的单位后会增加持续时间。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "burn_damage", "slow_movement_speed_pct", "projectile_speed", "multicast_delay", "ignite_multicast_aoe", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "ogre_magi_bloodlust", "name_zh": "食人魔魔法师·嗜血术", "name_en": "Bloodlust", "description_zh": "激起一个友方单位的狂暴，增加其移动和攻击速度。对食人魔魔法师自身施放时攻击速度加成更高。可以对防御塔施放。", "description_en": "Incites a frenzy in a friendly unit, increasing its movement speed and attack speed. Gives bonus attack speed if cast on Ogre himself. Can be cast on towers.", "notes_zh": ["触发多重施法时，%multicast_bloodlust_aoe%范围内的友方单位将随机获得嗜血术效果。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["modelscale", "bonus_movement_speed", "bonus_attack_speed", "self_bonus", "duration", "multicast_bloodlust_aoe", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "ogre_magi_unrefined_fireblast", "name_zh": "食人魔魔法师·未精通的火焰爆轰", "name_en": "Unrefined Fireblast", "description_zh": "操控一波火焰轰击一个敌方单位，造成%base_damage% + %str_multiplier%倍食人魔力量的伤害并使目标眩晕。魔法消耗为食人魔魔法师当前魔法的%scepter_mana%%%。", "description_en": "Blasts an enemy unit with a wave of fire, dealing %base_damage% + %str_multiplier%x Ogre's Strength in damage and stunning the target. Its mana cost is %scepter_mana%%% of Ogre Magi's current mana.", "notes_zh": ["触发多重施法时，两次火焰爆轰之间有%multicast_delay%秒的间隔。"], "granted_by": "scepter", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["stun_duration", "multicast_delay", "scepter_mana", "base_damage", "str_multiplier", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "ogre_magi_smash", "name_zh": "食人魔魔法师·烈火护盾", "name_en": "Fire Shield", "description_zh": "创造一个围绕友军目标的护盾，吸收接下来%attacks%次来自敌方英雄攻击的一定百分比伤害。吸收伤害后向攻击者发射火球。可以对防御塔施放。", "description_en": "Creates a shield around the target ally, absorbing a percentage of the damage of next %attacks% attacks from enemy heroes. When damage is absorbed, a fireball is launched at the attacker. Can be cast on towers.", "notes_zh": ["触发多重施法时，%multicast_fireshield_aoe%范围内的友方单位将随机获得烈火护盾效果。"], "granted_by": "shard", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage", "attacks", "duration", "multicast_fireshield_aoe", "projectile_speed", "damage_absorb_pct", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "ogre_magi_dumb_luck", "name_zh": "食人魔魔法师·傻福", "name_en": "Dumb Luck", "description_zh": "食人魔魔法师的智力值上限为0。他通过力量来获得魔法和魔法恢复。", "description_en": "Ogre Magi's max Intelligence is 0. He receives mana and mana regeneration from Strength.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["mana_per_str", "mana_regen_per_str", "level_one_ability_points", "level_two_ability_points", "required_level_reduction"]}, {"subject": "ogre_magi_multicast", "name_zh": "食人魔魔法师·多重施法", "name_en": "Multicast", "description_zh": "使食人魔魔法师在单次施法中有概率多次施放同一技能和物品。每%strength_for_one_pct%点力量提升%one_tooltip%%%多重施法几率。", "description_en": "Enables Ogre Magi to cast his abilities and items multiple times with each use. Each point of Strength adds to Multicast chance. Every %strength_for_one_pct% Strength adds %one_tooltip%%%.", "notes_zh": ["只有指向性技能和物品有几率触发多重施法。", "指向性技能和物品额外对食人魔周围一定作用范围内敌人和中立生物生效。火焰爆轰和未精通的火焰爆轰将对同个目标生效多次。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["multicast_2_times", "multicast_3_times", "multicast_4_times", "strength_for_one_pct", "one_tooltip"]}, {"subject": "undying_decay", "name_zh": "不朽尸王·腐朽", "name_en": "Decay", "description_zh": "不朽尸王偷取区域内所有敌方英雄的力量，造成基础伤害并将敌人的力量据为己有。对非英雄单位造成%creep_damage_multiplier%倍伤害。", "description_en": "Undying steals strength from all enemy heroes in an area, dealing base damage as he claims the enemy's strength for himself. Deals %creep_damage_multiplier%x damage to creeps.", "notes_zh": ["窃据的力量可以叠加，但是敌方英雄的力量至少为1点。", "力量的窃取先于技能造成的伤害。", "可以作用隐形单位。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "提升力量窃取。", "en": "Increases strength steal."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["decay_damage", "str_steal", "decay_duration", "radius", "str_scale_up", "creep_damage_multiplier", "shard_buff_duration", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityDuration", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "undying_soul_rip", "name_zh": "不朽尸王·噬魂", "name_en": "Soul Rip", "description_zh": "不朽尸王从附近的所有单位身上扯出生命力，并使用它治疗队友或伤害敌人。可以使用噬魂治疗墓碑。", "description_en": "Undying rips health away from all nearby units and uses it to heal an ally, or damage an enemy. Soul Rip can also be used to heal Tombstone.", "notes_zh": ["可以治疗墓碑，但是不能治疗或伤害其他建筑。", "不会扯出隐身单位、无敌单位、战争迷雾内单位或减益免疫敌人的生命力。", "可以扯出减益免疫友军，包括僵尸的生命力。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage_per_unit", "max_units", "radius", "tombstone_heal", "strength_share_percent", "strength_share_duration", "strength_share_model_scale", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "undying_tombstone", "name_zh": "不朽尸王·墓碑", "name_en": "Tombstone", "description_zh": "在目标位置召唤一座墓碑。墓碑会不断在其附近的每个敌方单位身边产生僵尸攻击他们。僵尸拥有死亡渴望技能，使他们的攻击带有减速效果，并且若目标的生命值低于一定百分比，僵尸的攻击和移动速度会提升。", "description_en": "Summons a tombstone at the target point.  Zombies will frequently spawn next to every enemy unit in the area around the Tombstone, and attack them.  Zombies have the Deathlust ability, which causes their attacks to slow the target, and if the target reaches below a certain amount of health, increases the attack and movement speed of the zombie.", "notes_zh": ["墓碑免疫技能，但是可以被噬魂治疗。", "僵尸和墓碑均免疫技能。", "如果初始目标死亡或丢失视野，僵尸将会死亡。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "墓碑可以对友方英雄施放，让他们躲进墓碑。进入墓碑的英雄%tombstone_bunker_cd%秒内无法离开，离开后同样的时间内无法再次进入。如果英雄在内时墓碑被摧毁，该英雄会被眩晕%tombstone_stun_penalty%秒。", "en": "Tombstone can be cast on an allied hero to bunker inside of the tombstone. Heroes that enter the Tombstone cannot leave for %tombstone_bunker_cd% seconds nor can they re-enter after leaving. If the tombstone is destroyed with a hero inside, that hero gets stunned for %tombstone_stun_penalty% seconds."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["tombstone_health", "hits_to_destroy_tooltip", "duration", "radius", "health_threshold_pct_tooltip", "zombie_interval", "zombie_damage_tooltip", "zombie_bonus_damage", "zombie_health", "bunker_units", "tombstone_grab_radius", "tombstone_bunker_cd", "tombstone_stun_penalty", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint"]}, {"subject": "undying_ceaseless_dirge", "name_zh": "不朽尸王·挽歌犹唱", "name_en": "Ceaseless Dirge", "description_zh": "不朽尸王阵亡时会立刻在泉水复活。比赛开始时处于冷却状态。无法被刷新。", "description_en": "When Undying dies he will instantly respawn in the fountain. Begins the game on cooldown. Cannot be refreshed.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["respawn_delay", "AbilityCooldown"]}]
